For GLSL image atomic operations on `float` data, use:

```glsl
imageAtomicAdd(IMAGE_PARAMS, float data);
imageAtomicExchange(IMAGE_PARAMS, float data);
```

The image variable must be a float image with the `r32f` format qualifier. With memory-scope parameters, `imageAtomicLoad` and `imageAtomicStore` are also available.
